,{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\Sigma^+\\times\\Sigma^+)^k\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\">\\(u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\">\\(v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_k=\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\">\\(J_k=\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota,\\tau\\in J_k^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota,\\tau\\in J_k^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_I,V_I:J_k^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(U_I,V_I:J_k^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 及两个解谓词均在此索引列表域上定义。</li>\n<li>列表位置从零编号；MPCP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是强制首块之后的尾列表，允许为空。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_I(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|\\iota|-1}u_{\\iota(j)},\\qquad\nV_I(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|\\iota|-1}v_{\\iota(j)}\n\\quad(\\iota\\in J_k^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_I(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|\\iota|-1}u_{\\iota(j)},\\qquad\nV_I(\\iota)\\coloneqq\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=0}^{|\\iota|-1}v_{\\iota(j)}\n\\quad(\\iota\\in J_k^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota\\in J_k^+\\land U_I(\\iota)=V_I(\\iota),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{MPCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\tau\\in J_k^*\\land u_0U_I(\\tau)=v_0V_I(\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\iota\\in J_k^+\\land U_I(\\iota)=V_I(\\iota),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{MPCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\tau\\in J_k^*\\land u_0U_I(\\tau)=v_0V_I(\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_\\Sigma(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\iota\\in J_k^+\\;\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SolveMPCP}_\\Sigma(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\in J_k^*\\;\\operatorname{MPCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_\\Sigma(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\iota\\in J_k^+\\;\\operatorname{PCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\iota),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SolveMPCP}_\\Sigma(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\in J_k^*\\;\\operatorname{MPCPSol}_\\Sigma(I,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PCP 解列表必须非空；MPCP 尾列表可以为空，因为已强制使用第一块一次。若 u₀=v₀，空尾列表就是 MPCP 解。固定使用非空上下词版本，与本册已有二进制 PCP 接口兼容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","e