":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$；对 $i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}$，$u_i=\\pi_1(I(i))$、$v_i=\\pi_2(I(i))$，采用 [[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions]] 的同一实例。索引字符 $a_i$、变量 $A,B,S$ 及终结字母表 $T$ 在下式用自然数构造。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-and-modified-pcp-solutions|PCP 与强制首块 MPCP 的解]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"e00951d7fc1c90e9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1774225169821832","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e905acae71a7676","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}